# Your personal settings for running the training scripts on your own PC.
#
#   1. Copy this file to a file named .env in the same folder.
#   2. Put your own values in .env.
#
# .env is listed in .gitignore: it is never committed and never part of a
# release. This file (.env.example) holds no secrets and stays empty.
#
# Home Assistant users do not need this: the integration asks for the
# Fingrid key in its own settings, and keeps it in your Home Assistant.

# Fingrid Open Data API key (optional - nuclear features)
# Register for free at https://data.fingrid.fi
# Without this key, the model trains on weather + cross-border features only (15 features)
# With this key, nuclear features are added (up to 17 features)
FINGRID_API_KEY=
